  "subject": "an old couple at a neighbourhood optician, where she spends an hour choosing his new frames and he says he only agrees because the first face he sees through them is hers",
  "caption": "Taiwanese Hokkien 1960s soul duet ballad, slow Memphis-style love duet. Warm electric piano chords; a clean hollow-body guitar with soft fills; mellow horn pads swelling on the chorus; brushed drums with a soft backbeat and a round bass. Vintage tape-warm studio sound, vocals close. A mature male and female duet, warm chest voices, trading lines and harmonising the chorus. 72 BPM, D♭ major. Tender, slow-burning and smiling. No trap hi-hats, no autotune, no EDM drop, no modern pop ballad piano, no orchestral strings swell, no rock guitar solo.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n目鏡行 的燈真光\n伊一支一支 共我試\n金框傷老 黑框傷凶\n伊講 閣換一支\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n我講 隨便就好\n伊講 你欲看規世人\n\n[Chorus]\n新目鏡 戴起來\n頭一个 看著是你\n你的皺痕 我看真清\n看清楚 嘛是你上媠\n\n[Verse]\n老闆 共阮笑規下晡\n講別人 攏無遮久\n伊共目鏡 拭甲金金\n共我 掛佇耳仔邊\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n彼一秒 我無講話\n干焦 一直看伊\n\n[Chorus]\n新目鏡 戴起來\n頭一个 看著是你\n你的頭毛 白甲真明\n白了 嘛是你上媠\n\n[Verse]\n轉去的路 牽伊的手\n紅綠燈 我看會著\n伊講 你較早看無\n我講 較早嘛看你\n\n[Bridge]\n五十冬 看你看無夠\n這馬 閣看較清楚\n看久 嘛袂厭\n\n[Chorus]\n新目鏡 戴起來\n看來看去 攏是你\n明年 換你配目鏡\n彼支框 我替你揀\n\n[Outro]\n頭一个 看著是你",
